---
title: Preview front door · one committed route revision per request
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant page as Preview tab
  participant door as Vercel front door
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant proxy as Sandbox port proxy
  participant mw as Runtime middleware

  loop Each HTTP request
    page->>door: HTTPS · session cookie
    door->>cp: GET /v1/preview/routes/{host}<br/>lane session credential
    cp-->>door: route record · revision, expiry, port URL
    alt Valid cookie and current route
      door->>proxy: caller headers stripped<br/>signed route claim + entry token
      Note over proxy: Replaces x-forwarded-host,<br/>passes custom headers.
      proxy->>mw: forwarded request
      Note over mw: Checks claim + token<br/>on every path.
      mw-->>door: product response
      door-->>page: response · no-store
    else Bare URL or stale route
      door-->>page: neutral interstitial · fail closed
    end
  end
  page->>door: SDK activation · same origin
  door->>cp: relay
  cp-->>door: signed attestation · session, runtime,<br/>revision · ingestion URL
  door-->>page: signed document proof · URL untouched
  page->>cp: SDK telemetry stream · direct wss
